Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A FIFO smoke test passes, yet the design still produces a ghost output.\NRTLRefine finds and replays the hidden failure before asking NVIDIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This authored FIFO passes all four smoke expectations.\NAn independent contract finds a failure in five symbolic clock states.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,After the accepted words have left, output-valid remains asserted.\NThe SAT inputs reproduce this in Icarus against a separate Python queue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.09,0:00:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A real NVIDIA Nemotron request through Nebius Token Factory.\NPublic source, contract and replay guide repair; final audit results stay hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:01:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nemotron fixes occupancy when enqueue and dequeue happen together.\NThe exact source passes the supplied tests and final bounds 16 and 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.12,0:01:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Reimport and rebuild the downloaded ZIP with no new model request.\NThe same fixed tests, bounded properties and progress checks run again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The export passes again. Evidence includes source hashes and tool logs.\NProgress checks exercise full, stalled, overlapping, wrapped and reset traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Change the contract: the old acceptance and checked download disappear.\NA successful verdict is tied to the exact source and configuration.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.18,0:02:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The declared eight-bit width disagrees with the four-bit DUT.\NIt is rejected before any paid diagnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.55,0:02:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A second authored defect passes its smoke test too.\NIndependent checks reproduce its premature pointer wrap in six states.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The healthy control passes without asking the model for a repair.\NThese are authored integration cases, not an unseen repair-accuracy benchmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.98,0:02:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Upload projects at /project; use /properties for the stated FIFO contract.\NPublic source and Docker test build: github.com/ehdtjq08/RTLRefine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.23,0:02:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Patch close-up: simultaneous push and pop leave occupancy unchanged.\NThe exact exported file passes the fixed final bounds and progress check.
